  "summary": "GitPython versions before 3.1.58 fail to validate options passed to git rm and git checkout commands in…",
  "details": "GitPython versions before 3.1.58 fail to validate options passed to git rm and git checkout commands in IndexFile.remove() and Head.checkout(). Attackers can supply --pathspec-from-file and --pathspec-file-nul parameters to read arbitrary files accessible to the process, with full file contents returned in GitCommandError.stderr.",
